  "dev_scoreboard_fence.scope_flag": "NOT SWEPT. No carrier in this experiment has a memory-ORDERING observable, so a pass would bound acceptance only. EXP-0141 swept all 256 values densely and refused promotion for exactly this reason; EXP-0147 reached the same INSUFFICIENT verdict; EXP-0152 pre-registered the same refusal. Stays `untested`. dev_scoreboard_fence therefore remains ONE FIELD SHORT.",
  "h_alu_hi.ctrl / h_alu_hi.mods": "NOT SWEPT \u2014 see db_defects: the observed high-half op is 4 bytes in this form, so those two modelled bytes are not part of it.",
